===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|arborētum||place grown with trees}}, from {{m|la|arbor||tree}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɑː(ɹ)bəˈɹiːtəm/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|arboreta}}

# A place where many [[variety|varieties]] of [[tree]] are grown for [[research]], [[educational]], and [[ornamental]] purposes.

